ut testnet target slot time from 400ms to 350ms, the first step toward 200ms target\\n\\n- @SatRushIO debuted SatRush, a gamified Bitcoin-mining reward protocol\\n\\n- @crittersquest launched Lucky Pick Mines on Solana\\n\\n- @magicblock and @SuperteamTH opened applications for the MagicBlock Founders Camp\\n\\n- Solana’s poker series returns at Breakpoint 2026 and WSOP Bahamas following the @WSOP Solana Showdown in Vegas\\n\\n- @SuperteamKorea set Solana Summit Korea for September 30 in Seoul\\n\\n- @solanaturbine opened Q3 applications for its revamped Builders Program\\n\\n- @spenders_club brings Solana Summer House back to LA on August 29 with @solanaspaces, @SolanaEvents, and @SolanaFndn\\n\\n������ Milestones\\n\\n- Solana captured ~$1.45B in July tokenized-equities volume, representing ~82% global market share\\n\\n- Tokenized Micron ($MU) shares topped $530M in spot volume within six weeks of launch\\n\\n- @ArcherExchange_ surpassed 1M trades on Solana\\n\\n- WSOP Solana Showdown crowned its first bracelet champion, @rasmr_eth\\n\\n- Frontier Traders crossed $1B in combined tokenized-equity spot and perps volume\\n\\n- @Rosentica One Arena crossed $3.3M in volume across 7.5K matches\\n\\n- @ShiftRWA crossed 1K unique tokenized-equity holders\\n\\n- @CandyDigital recorded its 5,000th digital collectible sale\\n\\n- @SolanaMBS marked five years since the Solana Monkey Business mint\\n\\n- @xStocksFi crossed 190K holders on Solana\\n\\nIf you enjoyed this week’s newsletter, repost it!\\n\\nArtwork by @ket_on_solana",
